 {"question":"Which comparison of simple and stratified cuboidal functions is correct?","choices":["Simple: protection and secretion; stratified: secretion and absorption.","Simple: secretion and absorption; stratified: protection and secretion.","Simple: diffusion and filtration; stratified: protection and secretion.","Simple: secretion and absorption; stratified: protection and absorption."],"answer_index":1},
