 {"question":"Which complete set of features applies to stratified cuboidal epithelium?","choices":["Cuboidal superficial cells; lines sweat-gland ducts and seminiferous tubules; protection and secretion.","Cuboidal superficial cells; lines kidney and seminiferous tubules; protection and secretion.","Flat superficial cells; lines sweat-gland ducts and seminiferous tubules; protection and secretion.","Cuboidal superficial cells; lines sweat-gland ducts and seminiferous tubules; secretion and absorption."],"answer_index":0}
