 {"question":"What characterizes the superficial cells of transitional epithelium?","choices":["Small umbrella-shaped cells with one or two nuclei.","Large cuboidal cells with one or two nuclei.","Large umbrella-shaped cells with one or two nuclei.","Small polyhedral cells with one or two nuclei."],"answer_index":2},
 {"question":"Which layer–cell-shape pairing is correct in transitional epithelium?","choices":["Middle: polyhedral; basal: cuboidal.","Middle: cuboidal; basal: polyhedral.","Superficial: cuboidal; middle: umbrella-shaped.","Superficial: polyhedral; basal: umbrella-shaped."],"answer_index":0},
 {"question":"Which transitional epithelial cells are cuboidal and rest on the basement membrane?","choices":["Superficial-layer cells.","Middle-layer cells.","Superficial- and middle-layer cells.","Basal-layer cells."],"answer_index":3},
